{
  "id": "MAT.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Mɛ̈T 16",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thiec ji̱ Pa-ri-thii kɛ nyuuth kä Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pa-ri-thii kɛnɛ ji̱ Thɛ̈d-du-thii ben, kä kɛ ɣöö görkɛ ɣɔ̱n Yecu, cukɛ jɛ thiec kɛ nyuuth mi gääy naath nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, “Mi ɛ thiaŋ, la yɛn ɛ wee bi ɣɔw a duäŋ duäŋ kɛ ɣöö tith pua̱a̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ɛ runwaŋ, la yɛn ɛ wee i̱, ‘Bɛ tekɛ thul ɛn wa̱lɛ kɛ ɣöö pua̱a̱r tithɛ kä wunɛ.’ Ŋa̱cɛ luɔt tääkä nhial, kä /cia luɔt kä tin tuɔɔk rɛy ɣɔaa ŋäc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ri̱c mi jiääk mi dho̱o̱m go̱o̱rɛ ni nyuuth mi gääy naath, thilɛ nyuuth mi ba ka̱m jɛ ɛ ni nyuuth Jona kärɔa.” Kä inɔ, cuɛ kɛ ba̱ny piny, cuɛ jiɛɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thuɔp ji̱ Pa-ri-thii kɛ ji̱ Thɛ̈d-du-thii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ji̱ kɔaarɛ cop kui̱ci, cu wuɔ̱thkiɛn ruëëc kɛ na̱ŋ mi̱thni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “Guecɛ agɔaa kä niɛkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ thuɔp ji̱ Pa-ri-thii kɛnɛ Thɛ̈d-du-thii.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ruac kärɔ̱, wäkɛ i̱, “Ɛ ɣöö thilɛ kɔn juray mi canɛ nööŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Yecu mɛmɛ ŋa̱c, cuɛ wee i̱, “Yɛn nɛy ti kuiy ŋa̱thdun, ɛŋu ruacɛ kɛ rɔ̱ mɔ ɛn ɣöö thilɛ yɛ mi̱th ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋotdɛ /kenɛ ni cop lɔɔcdun? Kä /cia jɛ tim, ɛn ɣöö kɛ jurayni da̱ŋ dhieec cuakɛ cam ɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔri da̱ŋ dhieec, kä kɛ diënyni da̱ŋ di kɛn tëë cia ruɔ̱ɔ̱l? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiɛ /ka̱nɛ jɛ tim, ɛn ɣöö kɛ jurayni da̱ŋ bärɔw kɛn tëë camkɛ ɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔri da̱ŋ ŋuan, kä kɛ diënyni da̱ŋ di kɛn tëë cia ruɔ̱ɔ̱l? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ku yɛn ɛ lɛ kui̱c i̱di ɛn ɣöö /cä ruac kɛ kui̱ jurayä? Niɛkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ thuɔp ji̱ Pa-ri-thii kɛnɛ Thɛ̈d-du-thii!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ, cukɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö /cɛ ruac kɛ kɛ i̱ niɛkɛ rɔ̱ kɛ thuɔp jurayni, kä ruacɛ kɛ kɛ, kɛ ciaaŋ ŋi̱i̱cä ji̱ Pa-ri-thii kɛnɛ Thɛ̈d-du-thii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Min laar Pi-tɔr ɛ kɛ kui̱ Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ mëë ci Yecu ben rɛy rööl Thɛ-tha-ria kä Pi-li-pi, cuɛ ji̱ kɔaarɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛŋa mi lat naath ɛ i̱ ɛ Gat Ran?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Laar tha̱a̱ŋ nath ɛ i̱ ɛ Jɔ̱ɔ̱n in la lääk, kä ɛ tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn i̱ ɛ E-li-yaa, kä ɛ tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn i̱ ɛ Yir-mɛ-yaa, kiɛ ram kɛl kä göök.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Kä laar yɛn ɛ i̱ ɛ ɣän ŋa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Thay-mɔn Pi-tɔr ɛ loc i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n Mɛ-thia, Gat Kuɔth in tëk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu jɛ jiök i̱, “Puɔ̱th akɛ ji̱, Thay-mɔn, gat Jona! Kɛ ɣöö /ciɛ ram mi tekɛ ri̱ŋ kɛnɛ riɛm nyuthɛ ji̱ mɔ, ɛ jɛn Gua̱a̱r in te nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän larä jɛ ji̱, ɛ ji̱n Pi-tɔr, kä wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ thok ji̱ Gɛ-rith ciöt ni Pi-tɔr lotdɛ ni ɣöö päm.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ɛmɛ ɣän bä luaakdä la̱t thi̱n, kä /ci buɔ̱m li̱eth ɛ bi luäŋ kɛ tiëm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bä ji̱ ka̱m leepni ciëŋ kuäärä nhial, kä mi wiaa yiɛn wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n ba jɛ yiɛn cieŋ nhial. Kä mi wiaa lony wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, ba jɛ lony cieŋ nhial.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ji̱ kɔaarɛ gok a bum ɛn ɣöö thilɛ ram mi bi kɛn ɛ la̱r ɛ ɛn ɣöö ɛ jɛn Mɛ-thia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lär Yecu kɛ lia̱a̱dɛ kɛnɛ jiëcdɛ kɛ rɔ li̱th",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jɛn gua̱a̱th ɛmɔ cu Yecu ɛ tok kɛ mi nyuthɛ ji̱ kɔaarɛ, ɣöö bɛ rɔ dhil kɛ wä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä bɛ ti bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c ti ŋuan wä rut kä di̱t ji̱ Juudh kɛnɛ bööth palä tin di̱t amäni ji̱ gɔ̱rä, kä ba jɛ näk, kä ba jɛ jiɛc li̱th kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱k ni̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pi-tɔr ɛ naŋ gekä, kä cuɛ jɛ tok kɛ lui̱k, wëë i̱, “Bi Kuoth kɛ gaŋ kä ji̱, Kuäär ni Kuoth! Mɛmɛ /cɛ bi met tuɔɔk kä ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ rɔ ri̱t, kä jio̱kɛ Pi-tɔr i̱, “Woc rɔ kä ɣä Cɛy-tan, ɛ ji̱n riɛk dupdä kɛ ɣöö /ci lät ni tin bä kä Kuoth, cärku /cikɛ bä kä Kuoth bäkɛ kä naath.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jiök i̱, “Mi tee kɛ ram mi go̱o̱r ɣöö bɛ ɣä guɔ̱ɔ̱r, a jɛ jay rɔɔdɛ, kä a jɛ kap jiathdɛ, kä a jɛ guur ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ram mi go̱o̱r ɣöö bɛ tëkdɛ kän bɛ jɛ bath, kä ram mi tho̱p tëkdɛ kɛ kui̱dä bɛ jɛ jek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛŋu mi dee raan ɛ jek mi cɛ ɣɔw kɛɛliw jek, kä cɛ tëkdɛ bath? Kiɛ ɛŋu mi dee raan ɛ thöp kɛ ɣöö bɛ tëkdɛ luɔ̱ɔ̱c jɔk? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bi Gat Ran kɛnɛ ja̱a̱kɛ kɛ gɔɔy puɔnyä Gua̱n ben, kä ɛn guäth ɛmɔ bɛ nɛy diaal culikä kɛ min ci kɛn ɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, tëë kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ nath ti te cuŋä wanɛ mɛ, ti /ci bi li̱w amäni mi cikɛ Gat Ran nɛn a bëë rɛy kuäärädɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
